# A new window takes after the window in use (12 Nov 2026: ⇧⌘N from a window with its sidebar
# hidden opened docked, and its command bar was a white card on the dark Incognito window): ⌘N and
# ⇧⌘N keep the sidebar hidden, open at the same size one step on (CraCore NewWindowLayout), and an
# Incognito window's command bar is dark whatever macOS uses (CommandBarTones.appearance).
# Full screen is new-window-fullscreen's (it takes over a Space).
home
seed settings.json {"hasSeenImportPrompt": true, "toolbarDefaultMigrated": true}
cra://debug?windowSize=1200x800
wait 1.5
cra://action/toggleSidebar
wait 1
cra://debug?windowState=source
expect-log window state source: main0 .*size=1200x800 .*docked=0
cra://action/newWindow
expect-log new window: sidebar hidden$
wait 2
cra://debug?windowState=normal
expect-log window state normal: main1 .*size=1200x800 .*docked=0
cra://action/newIncognitoWindow
expect-log new incognito window: sidebar hidden$
wait 2
cra://debug?windowState=incognito
expect-log window state incognito: main2 .*size=1200x800 .*docked=0
cra://debug?commandBarState=incognito
expect-log command bar incognito: open=1 .* dark=1
